    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Adapt, and Survive Across Time.</strong> <i>Biorage</i> is an intense <strong>story-driven FPS</strong> set in a fractured timeline where the rebellious force &quot;Freedom for All Rebellion&quot; clashes against the corporate empire &quot;Tempus Industries&quot;. Experience <strong>15 meticulously crafted levels across 5 visually stunning chapters</strong>, where time itself is your greatest enemy. After the main character gets trapped by Tempus in a failed mission, you're left isolated\u2014stranded between past, present, and a future spiraling into chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u23f1\ufe0f The Main Story is about 1 hour long, the extra modes add up to 10+ hours of gameplay!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>High-Quality Story Mode</strong> \u2013 Battle through <strong>15 handcrafted levels</strong> with immersive storytelling and explosive action.<br>\u23f3 <strong>Time-Warped Warfare</strong> \u2013 A rebellion vs. corporation conflict that warps reality itself and sends the player towards many different universes with different enemies and conflicts.<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>10 Extra Challenge Modes</strong> \u2013 Push your limits with <strong>ultra-hard challenges</strong> and experimental gameplay twists:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impossible Mode</strong> \u2013 Don\u2019t try this. Seriously. (No Guns/Melee + No Checkpoints + No Healing + Permadeath + Half Health)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melee Only</strong> \u2013 Fight with fists and blades. No guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Guns, No Melee</strong> \u2013 Find a way to make enemies take each other out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Soldiers Mode (Walking Sim)</strong> \u2013 A combat-free journey through the world, story intact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Checkpoints -\u00a0</strong>Start the level over if you die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Healing -</strong> Turns the 15 level campaign into careful health management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong>\u00a0- 1 death and game over plus health is halved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Mode</strong> \u2013 Levels shuffled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backwards Mode</strong> \u2013 Play the campaign <strong>in reverse</strong>, from Level 15 to Level 1.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong> \u2013 No obstacles, no limits. Just pure speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge modes remove all dialogue for a pure gameplay experience and lower the graphical quality for peak performance\u00a0</strong>(the walking sim mode keeps dialogue enabled)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to shatter the limits of time?</p>",
